# What the two locked source packages build with (jericho: setup.py alone,
# so setuptools and wheel; fast-downward-textworld: setuptools >= 61 and
# cmake) and the package itself (setuptools >= 68), resolved by
# scripts/exp0001/lock_colab_environment.sh into build-constraints.txt, which
# the install passes to uv as build constraints. setuptools is the lock's own
# version. uv checks the hash of every tool named here; a build tool not
# named here would install unpinned, so a lock that gains a source package or
# a build requirement changes this file too.
setuptools==80.10.2
wheel
cmake
